{"title":"15","section":"7407","heading":"Authorization of appropriations","lead":"There are authorized to be appropriated to the Secretary of Commerce for the National Institute of Standards and Technology—","tree":[{"marker":"(1)","path":"(1)","heading":"","text":"for activities under section 278h of this title—","children":[{"marker":"(A)","path":"(1)(A)","heading":"","text":"$25,000,000 for fiscal year 2003;","children":[]},{"marker":"(B)","path":"(1)(B)","heading":"","text":"$40,000,000 for fiscal year 2004;","children":[]},{"marker":"(C)","path":"(1)(C)","heading":"","text":"$55,000,000 for fiscal year 2005;","children":[]},{"marker":"(D)","path":"(1)(D)","heading":"","text":"$70,000,000 for fiscal year 2006;","children":[]},{"marker":"(E)","path":"(1)(E)","heading":"","text":"$85,000,000 for fiscal year 2007; and","children":[]}]},{"marker":"(2)","path":"(2)","heading":"","text":"for activities under section 278g–3(f) 1 of this title—","children":[{"marker":"(A)","path":"(2)(A)","heading":"","text":"$6,000,000 for fiscal year 2003;","children":[]},{"marker":"(B)","path":"(2)(B)","heading":"","text":"$6,200,000 for fiscal year 2004;","children":[]},{"marker":"(C)","path":"(2)(C)","heading":"","text":"$6,400,000 for fiscal year 2005;","children":[]},{"marker":"(D)","path":"(2)(D)","heading":"","text":"$6,600,000 for fiscal year 2006; and","children":[]},{"marker":"(E)","path":"(2)(E)","heading":"","text":"$6,800,000 for fiscal year 2007.","children":[]}]}],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"referencesInText","text":"References in TextSection 278g–3 of this title, referred to in par. (2), was amended by Pub. L. 107–347, title III, § 303, Dec. 17, 2002, 116 Stat. 2957, and, as so amended, did not contain a subsec. (f). A later amendment by Pub. L. 113–274, title II, § 204(1), Dec. 18, 2014, 128 Stat. 2980, redesignated subsec. (e) of section 278g–3 of this title, relating to definitions, as (f)."}],"sourceCredit":"(Pub. L. 107–305, § 11, Nov. 27, 2002, 116 Stat. 2379.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 15—","heading":"COMMERCE AND TRADE","identifier":"/us/usc/t15"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 100—","heading":"CYBER SECURITY RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT","identifier":"/us/usc/t15/ch100"}]}